  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "wonder 是常考单词，常出现在保持句意基本不变的句型转换练习中，所以学生一定要知道：wonder 与 want to know 意思相同，在句中可以互换。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：Mike’s parents "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "wonder"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " whether he likes his new job."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "= Mike’s parents "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "want to know"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " whether he likes his new job."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "麦克的父母想知道他是否喜欢他的新工作。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
